  "description": "When Detective I-Hwa goes undercover to dismantle a drug syndicate, his mission clear: get close to its cold-blooded boss, Tae-Gon. At first, the plan runs smoothly, until Tae-Gon sees through the disguise. But instead of handing I-Hwa over, he traps him with threats and twisted control, forcing him to stay at his side. As I-Hwa searches for a way out, fragments of a past he thought forgotten begin to surface, revealing that his connection to Tae-Gon runs far deeper than he ever imagined...\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
